  "Cui, Cui Mini APP and related services may be offered by one or more group, affiliated or service entities. The contracting entity, registration details, licence references, payment terms and client-money arrangements should be reviewed in the applicable legal documents and account-opening flow before any live trading activity.": "Cui、Cui Mini APP 及相关服务可能由一个或多个集团、关联或服务实体提供。签约实体、注册信息、牌照编号、支付条款与客户资金安排，应在任何实盘交易前于适用的法律文件与开户流程中审阅。",
  "Cui provides general product information, education content, market commentary and community access pathways. The content on this website should not be treated as investment advice, a personal recommendation or an offer to residents of any jurisdiction where such access would be contrary to local law or regulation.": "Cui 提供一般性产品信息、教育内容、市场评论与社区接入渠道。本网站内容不构成投资建议或个人推荐，也不向禁止此类访问的司法管辖区居民发出要约。",
  "*Does not imply guaranteed performance. CFDs, forex, crypto-related instruments and copy-trading strategies involve significant risk and may not be suitable for all investors.": "*不构成任何收益保证。CFD、外汇、加密货币相关工具及跟单策略存在重大风险，可能不适合所有投资者。",
  "RISK WARNING :": "风险警告：",
  "Trading derivatives carries significant risks. You may lose some or all of your invested capital. When acquiring derivative products, you may have no entitlement, right or obligation to the underlying financial assets. Past performance is not an indication of future performance and demo results use virtual funds only.": "交易衍生品存在重大风险。您可能会损失部分或全部投入资金。购买衍生品时，您可能对标的金融资产没有任何权利或义务。过往表现不代表未来表现，模拟结果仅使用虚拟资金。",
  "The information on this website is general in nature and does not take into account your personal objectives, financial circumstances or needs. Before making any trading decision, consider whether the product is suitable for you and seek independent advice where necessary. Please read the applicable": "本网站信息具有一般性质，未考虑您的个人目标、财务状况或需求。在做出任何交易决定之前，请评估该产品是否适合您，必要时寻求独立建议。请阅读适用的",
